WEBVTT

00:00:06.364 --> 00:00:12.364
Choose Analytics in the side menu.

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:25.409
Click Washing Hands the
Right Way in Top titles.

00:00:34.147 --> 00:00:40.147
Check that the Finished
watching tile shows a percent.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:55.610
Scroll to Views each day.

00:01:01.576 --> 00:01:07.576
Scroll to Where viewers stop.

00:01:14.024 --> 00:01:20.024
Click Last 90 days.
